                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                        "entry_id": "0c95359d-6220-393b-a037-64fd6935d383",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vain ; inutile."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d3943b6-49c9-427b-bd59-16780eac326b",
                                "sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                                "text": "Telles sont, brièvement citées, les impitoyables poses que cet iconoclaste assigne à l’être que d’inanes galanteries encensent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dfdda5b-ac5e-40ee-a02d-b6a56b78a626",
                                "sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                                "text": "Neige et roses, jardin aboli par la grêle !\nPuisqu’est la femme un être inane et sans pitié,\nO pipe des aïeux au long calumet grêle,\nClystère ! purgez-moi de l’humaine amitié !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e9923a7-ede4-428a-86a0-2f70a6e34a91",
                                "sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                                "text": "Ces pensées d’un Bolchevik, sur un sujet qu’immortalisa le duc de La Rochefoucauld, n’étaient pas totalement inanes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0c1ad3f-1192-42a7-98e8-827fbaa1cad3",
                                "sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                                "text": "L’amateur de fleurs ne recevrait de moi que d’inanes gerbes funèbres."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06ce355b-a3bf-457a-9b2a-3847927ac100",
                                "sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                                "text": "Je dis : Là-bas (dans un nol-lieu, certes), les possibles conservent, pour ma certitude, non nulle, une mienne apparence. Et la Psyché les qualifie, énigmatiquement, de réels. Autant qu’elle (aussi inane soit-elle)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a71b8ad8-d632-4137-b846-5af4f55a0ae8",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c95359d-6220-393b-a037-64fd6935d383",
                        "source_sense_id": "b64aaa89-fdaa-3c8e-916b-ba56a9114758",
                        "target_lang_word": "inane",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inane",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa199aa1-3be5-31ad-ae80-a271febc7e09",
                                        "entry_id": "d642e3f5-d76f-38d4-9061-c7cdd617fdc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking sense or meaning, often to the point of boredom or annoyance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c0a98e7-17ba-4a4f-9fa8-b24346d77cb2",
                                                "sense_id": "fa199aa1-3be5-31ad-ae80-a271febc7e09",
                                                "text": "Francesca followed, reluctant enough in her secret; for though she would not have admitted it even to herself, she did shrink from the infliction of the inane solemnities with which her father garnished his discourse—to say nothing of the ungracious reflections which so often glanced at herself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfd7cc2c-c8ac-4c63-ad9b-2b496e165de3",
                                                "sense_id": "fa199aa1-3be5-31ad-ae80-a271febc7e09",
                                                "text": "God, if she had to listen to another conversation about some kid she didnʼt know—how Tina J. stole the stage at the talent show or Bobby R. won the tee ball game or any other number of inane accomplishments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c043056-6763-4801-bd7f-a16314322aa9",
                                                "sense_id": "fa199aa1-3be5-31ad-ae80-a271febc7e09",
                                                "text": "This supremely gifted kid told me that in the early elementary grades, the songs sung in music class were so inane that he wanted to skip grades already! Eventually he did, so better late than never."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72f3cf75-268c-37ba-be08-db5367b8c62a",
                                        "entry_id": "d642e3f5-d76f-38d4-9061-c7cdd617fdc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Purposeless; pointless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7f831a8-f1ab-402c-8027-3252f50d4fac",
                                                "sense_id": "72f3cf75-268c-37ba-be08-db5367b8c62a",
                                                "text": "Vague and inane instincts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "inane",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6430ca51-176b-3627-b3f2-92675ab34bee",
                                        "entry_id": "592cfbf3-5505-3ad5-bca9-38ff3e46a27b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is void or empty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "515a3195-9578-4deb-848a-9cfe5cd41555",
                                                "sense_id": "6430ca51-176b-3627-b3f2-92675ab34bee",
                                                "text": "The undistinguishable inane of infinite space."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b449fdb1-2e62-4177-95e5-1111e5cccbee",
                                                "sense_id": "6430ca51-176b-3627-b3f2-92675ab34bee",
                                                "text": "[...] whom we watch as we watch the clouds careering in the windy, bottomless inane, or read about like characters in ancient and rather fabulous annals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d4ff3b8-f7d7-4e7e-a52e-6db0255fc2a6",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c95359d-6220-393b-a037-64fd6935d383",
